## Purpose

Correct the released 100k experience so it functions as the project owner's strategic cockpit,
while preserving the deterministic shared projection and complete-accounting guarantees delivered
by IDEA-0028.

## Desired Outcome

The normal `work/100k.md` and `ts: 100k` experience answers why the project exists, what completion
currently means, what changed, what matters now, which decisions need attention, and which next
cycles are credible. One narrowly authoritative executive-intent document supplies owner-authored
strategy; existing Tool Shed artifacts retain execution authority; the generated view joins both.

The main view no longer contains the exhaustive Complete Strategic Ledger. Complete accounting
remains deterministic and available through explicit drill-down.

