## Settled Direction

- Introduce one singleton managed `project-executive-intent` document per project using existing
  document revision primitives; add no new database table or lifecycle engine.
- Executive intent owns only the North Star, current horizon, strategic framing, priorities,
  deliberate non-goals, decisions, and review triggers.
- Existing Ideas, maps, PRMs, campaigns, outcomes, relationships, evidence, and planning order own
  execution and lifecycle truth.
- Keep `work/100k.md` and bare `ts: 100k` deterministic and read-only.
- Remove the Complete Strategic Ledger section from the main Markdown. Retain complete accounting
  through an explicit bounded deterministic ledger command/output.
- Treat missing executive intent and all-terminal operational state as an executive decision signal,
  not proof that no strategic work remains.
- Subsequent explicit owner choices route through existing guarded mutations; reading 100k never
  changes priority or starts work.
- Preserve IDEA-0028 and v0.55.0 as history. This map owns the residual experience correction.

